      "jcr:created": "Wed Oct 19 2022 15:04:01 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Femoral tray system</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Stryker’s femoral tray system is built for efficiency. One general hip instrument tray is compatible across three femoral stems (Insignia, Accolade II, Exeter), allowing for minimal tray usage and cross-compatibility.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Streamlined instrumentations and fewer trays can help lower sterilization costs and create a system more suitable for today’s health care environment, including Ambulatory Surgery Centers (ASC).</span></span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Dec 08 2023 15:01:18 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
