      "jcr:created": "Wed Oct 19 2022 15:04:01 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Broach handles</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Broach handles feature a lever that is designed to actively secure the broach. This designis meant to minimize potential toggle and facilitate reproducibility of bone preparation.Each handle is fully compatible with Accolade II, Exeter, and Insignia femoral systems.</span></span></p>\n",
